  "question": {
    "text": "The value of&nbsp;<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to (where <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> represents the greatest integer part of <math><mi>x</mi></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
