  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now, we have,<br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />and, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#931;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#931;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Thus, we have,<br /><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />Now, we have,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, by Sandwich Theorem, we have<br /><br /><math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>",
